    1. Pick grid H in [12,27], W in [14,25]
    2. Pick fg color from {1,3,4,5,6,7,8,9} (exclude RED=2)
    3. Choose blank row count in [0,3] and blank col count in [1,2], ensuring total >=2
    4. Place blank rows/cols at non-edge positions with >=1 gap between them and edges
    5. Fill non-blank cells randomly with fg at ~70% density and bg at ~30%
    6. For each non-blank row, if it has no fg pixel, flip one random bg cell to fg
    7. For each non-blank col, if it has no fg pixel, flip one random bg cell to fg
    8. Set every cell in blank rows and blank cols to bg (ensuring they are fully bg)
